    "created_at": "2017-06-02T16:53:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-06-02T16:53:59Z",
    "body": "In addition in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#parse-error-invalid-first-character-of-tag-name:\r\n\r\n> Such code points and all content that follows up to a U+003E (>) code point (if present) or to the end of the input stream is treated as text content (if the start tag name is expected) or as a comment (if the end tag name is expected).\r\n\r\nshould be\r\n\r\n> If a start tag was expected such code points and preceding U+003C (<) is treated as text content, and all content that follows is treated as markup. Whereas, if an end tag was expected, such code points and all content that follows up to a U+003E (>) code point (if present) or to the end of the input stream is treated as a comment.",
